    "MDD": "Major depressive disorder (PGC-MDD: Wray 2018 Nat Genet, Howard 2019 Nat Neurosci). Engine link: D2 reward/affect.",
    "ADHD": "Attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (Demontis 2019/2023 Nat Genet).",
